{"slug":"upi-transactions","path":"official","kind":"timeseries","page_url":"https://www.rbi.org.in/Scripts/PSIUserView.aspx","frequency":"M","graph":"line","title":"UPI Transactions (RBI)","description":"Unified Payments Interface (UPI) transactions processed each month: volume in lakh transactions and value in Rs. crore, as reported in the RBI's Payment System Indicators. UPI is India's dominant retail digital payment rail (person-to-person and person-to-merchant), so its volume tracks small-ticket consumption and its value tracks larger transfers. It is published within about a month, well before GDP data, making it a useful real-time proxy for private consumption and the formalisation of retail spending. 1 lakh = 0.1 million.","headline":{},"source":"Reserve Bank of India - Payment System Indicators","source_url":"https://www.rbi.org.in/Scripts/PSIUserView.aspx","date_modified":null,"views":[{"id":"volume","label":"Volume","series":[{"id":"upi_vol","name":"UPI","units":"Lakh transactions","pts":[[1622505600,28075.16],[1625097600,32455.02],[1627776000,35555.45],[1630454400,36558.17],[1633046400,42184.32],[1635724800,41864.8],[1638316800,45662.99],[1640995200,46171.56],[1643673600,45274.89],[1646092800,54056.51],[1648771200,55843.88],[1651363200,59462.89],[1654041600,58629.08],[1656633600,62893.4],[1659312000,65819.06],[1661990400,67808],[1664582400,73054.21],[1667260800,73094.47],[1669852800,78288.95],[1672531200,80385.88],[1675209600,75347.57],[1677628800,86516.34],[1680307200,88632.6],[1682899200,94151.85],[1685577600,93350.61],[1688169600,99642.56],[1690848000,105860.16],[1693526400,105556.87],[1696118400,114087.9],[1698796800,112352.92],[1701388800,120202.26],[1704067200,122030.18],[1706745600,121026.73],[1709251200,134400.04],[1711929600,133039.94],[1714521600,140358.43],[1717200000,138851.42],[1719792000,144355.54],[1722470400,149630.47],[1725148800,150417.47],[1727740800,165849.66],[1730419200,154820.21],[1733011200,167300.09],[1735689600,169960.01],[17383